     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"clear:both\"><font color=\"#242729\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">Hello everyone,</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font color=\"#242729\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font color=\"#242729\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">I&#39;m trying to extract the variances from a &quot;lavaan&quot; object. </span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font color=\"#242729\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><span style=\"color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">&quot;fit&quot; is a lavaan object. &quot;summary(fit)&quot; gives my a detailed output with informations on the model, including a table with variances:</span></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><span style=\"color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"><br></span></p><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">Variances</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                   </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Estimate</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Std</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Err</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  Z</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">value  P</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(&gt;|</span><span style=\"color:#000\">z</span><span style=\"color:#660\">|)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    v1             </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.350</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.121</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2.898</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.004</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    v2             </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.473</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.121</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3.924</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.000</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    etc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><p style=\"clear:both\"><br><font color=\"#242729\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font color=\"#242729\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">How can I extract these values from the object? </span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font color=\"#242729\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font color=\"#242729\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">Thanks,</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font color=\"#242729\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">Tim</span></font></p></div>"
